<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh Jan industry output rises 0.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh Jan industry output rises 0.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's industrial output fell by 7.4 percent in January but was 0.3 percent higher than a year earlier, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKH INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   Jan 97    Dec 96    Jan 96</p>
<p>    mth/mth pct change	   -7.4	+9.8	-10.9</p>
<p>    yr/yr   pct change	   +0.3     -14.5	 -3.8</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
